# Copy to .env.local (or run `make init`). .env.local is gitignored.
#
# Dev-only Google OAuth client id. Chrome Web Store's client is registered against the
# published extension ID, which differs from a locally "Load unpacked" build's ID, so
# Google sign-in only works locally with a second OAuth client of type "Chrome Extension"
# whose Item ID is your unpacked extension's ID (chrome://extensions).
# Used by `make dev` / `make build`; ignored by `make build-release`.
VITE_DEV_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
